  <Key>SHADOWLORD</Key>
  <Name>Shadow Lord</Name>
  <Description>Syndicates are enterprises, which means they have two things: people to do the work, and the bosses who tell them what to do. When a character reaches a certain level of prestige, importance, and resources within a syndicate, they gain access to expendable underlings, who are at a Shadow Lord's beck and call, prepared to do what it takes to earn the favor of their superior.
[P]Once per session, the character may spend 2 Destiny Points and make a [B]Hard ([DI][DI][DI]) Streetwise check[b] to summon agents from an allied criminal syndicate. On success, an allied Minion group with a number of minions equal to 2 + [SU] appear as a group in the scene from a location of the Game Master's choosing. They will work at the character's direction and will assist on even the most dangerous of tasks.</Description>
  <Source>reSpecialized Project</Source>
